# NOTE: .dockerignore patterns are root-anchored. A bare `__pycache__` or
# `*.csv` only matches at the top of the build context, so nested copies are
# still sent to the daemon and baked into the image. Keep the `**/` prefix on
# anything that can appear in a subdirectory.

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Python
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build

# Virtual environments
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# IDE
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Data files (should be uploaded via web interface). Captures identify real
# ESXi hosts, VMs and LUNs, so these must never reach a published image.
**/*.csv
**/*.data
**/*.png
**/*_col_ids

# Meta files
**/*.meta

# Legacy
legacy/

# Documentation
**/*.md

# Tests
tests/

# Local config
.claude/
